// Multicellular Herald (enemy_1438_dspred) and Allotropic Herald (_2): melee Seaborn that can devour an Excrescent
// Carapace once.
// - Skill "0" (cooldown 1,000,000, so once): its trigger takes the first opposing unit within range_radius (0.35),
//   target-free ones included (carapaces are target-free). dspred_tr_1 on that unit, unless the Herald already ate,
//   triggers skill "1" on it (interrupting the current action).
// - Skill "1": the Skill clip (2.6 s; its only event is an audio cue, so the cast lands at the clip's end).
//   dspred_tr_1[kill]: if the target is an Excrescent
//   Carapace (trap_156_dsshell_passive) it is killed and the Herald is marked as having eaten. When the cast ends
//   dspred_tr_1[switch_mode_2]: if it ate, mode 1 (the B_ clips, the same melee attack), MAX_HP and ATK MULTIPLIER
//   from the skill's maxhp (0.7) and atk (0.4), and the mark that stops any further meal.
// - KilledToLog: a kill counter.
